{"id": "3001410", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3001410", "title": "Ia\u0219i Open 2022 \u2013 Dublu feminin", "text": "Ia\u0219i Open 2022 \u2013 Dublu feminin a avut loc \u00een prima jum\u0103tate a lunii august 2022. \u0218aisprezece perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Ia\u0219i, Rom\u00e2nia, disputat pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een aer liber. A fost prima edi\u021bie a turneului feminin.\nDaria Astakhova \u0219i Andreea Ro\u0219ca au c\u00e2\u0219tigat title, \u00eenving\u00e2nd perechea R\u00e9ka Luca Jani \u0219i Panna Udvardy \u00een final\u0103, cu scorul de 7\u20135, 5\u20137, [10\u20137]."}
